        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūntogwa na kūng'wigwa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū shikwigelile kūntogwa ū SEEBA Mulungu wako shikū jose; na kwīdima pyī īyo ayīlagīlile, na a malange gakwe, nī shilagīlo shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ideedeng'hanyagi chiza ī lelo nguno natūlūngalūngaga na bana bing'we, a boi batībonile, nūūlū ītītilwe mu shikū jabo ī milīmo ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, īyo wītūmamīlaga mu kahūgūlīle",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kahūgūlīle:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kahamīle; būhami bo kūtūmamīla mihayo ya kūminya nūūlū kūsaatya, nūūlū gītī kūtūmamīla inasu kūlanga bana.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kakwe; nī likūjo lyakwe batalībonile, nū būdūla wa nkono gwakwe, nūūlū ūmo akagūgoloolela ū nkono gwakwe batabonile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batashibonile nī shimanīkījo īsho washibeejaga mu sī ya Misili kū būtongi bo ng'wa Falao, ū ntemi wa Misili, nū mu sī yakwe ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benabo batabonile nūūlū ūmo akalyītīla ū SEEBA ī libità lya bashilikale ba Bamisili nī falasa jabo, na a magogoteni gabo, ū ng'wikanza īlo baamukūūbījaga; aho akabalibīja mu minzī ga Nyanza Yaza, pyī būshila fu, ūbayagaja ilalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana bing'we batayībonile īyo wang'wītīla ū ng'witogolo kūshisha ng'ūshika a hipandī lyenīlī mulī ī haha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batīībonile nī yīyo akabīītīla ba Dasani na Abilamu, a bitūnja ba ng'wa Eliabu wa lūganda lwa Lubeni; aho sī īkalugūka ha gatī gatī ya Baisilaeli, yūbamila a banhū benabo nī kaya jabo, na a maheema gabo, nī shikolo shabo shose ī shipanga īsho baalī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miso ging'we benekīlī ayo gayībona ī mihayo ī mitaale yenīyī, īyo SEEBA wayīta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkomelejiwa kūdima shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū shidimagi ī shilagīlo ī shose īsho nalīng'winha lelo, hū mukūbiza na nguzu ja kwīdima ībize ying'we ī sī īyo mulīkīla mongo gwa Yolodani kūja kwīsola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko hū mukūbiza na būlamu būlīhu ū mu sī īyo SEEBA wabilahīlīla bakūlūgenji bing'we nī shibyalīlwe shabo gīkī, akūbinha ī sī ya būhondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī īyo mulīkīla kūja kwīsola yenīyo ītabizile gīt'ūmo īlī sī ya Misili ūko mulīfuma, ūko ng'wajihambaga ī mbīyū jing'we hū ng'walinhya kūshaadūūka lwa magūlū mukūjitīīlaga minzī gītī shisasīla",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shisasīla:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kangūnda kadoololo ka makūbī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sha makūbī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī sī īyo mulīkīla mongo gwa Yolodani kūja kwīsola, ī yene īpīndiwe ngūlū, hama īlī na malago gawiza no; nīyo īkang'waga minzī ga mbula kwīnga kwigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wako īdīlīlile no ī sī yenīyo; a miso ga ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako galolelile ho pye a makanza, kūfuma wandījo wa ng'waka kūshisha kū būkalīkījo wago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūlū ng'ūbiza bigwi na bakalalwa ū kūshishikīlīja ī shilagīlo īsho nalīng'winha lelo īyī, kūntogwa ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, na kūntūmamīla we na ng'holò yose na būpanga bose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho hū nakūmutūmīla mbula ū mu sī ying'we ng'wikanza lyayo; ī mbula ya wandījo wa shidikū nī ya kū būkalīkījo wa ng'waka, ūdūle kūyūpandīka chiza ī shilīwa nī divai, na a maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu madīīmīlo gako nakūkūzwisīja maswa ga kūyūlya ī mitugo jako jigeja; nū bebe ng'wenekīlī ūkūyūlya ī shilīwa wigūta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanagi gete, ī ng'holò jing'we jitizūhūmbūūlwa mugalūke ng'wandye kūlamya bamulungu bangī, na kūbinamīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'wīta gīko ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA būkūmupembekela alīlugale ī ligūlū yooye ū kūtūla ī mbula, nī sī yooye ū kūtwaja a matwajo gayo. Ū mu gīko mutūdīla ū kūyagaala na kūshila ū mu sī yawiza īyo SEEBA alīng'winha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bana balangwe shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo yane yenīyī īdimagi na būkalalwa ū mu ng'holò nū mu maganiko ging'we; ng'wītunge ū kū nkono nū kū būshū wing'we, ībize būmanīkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyūbalanga mu welwa ng'holò a bana bing'we; ūlū ng'wigashaga mu kaya ng'wīhooyela, nūūlū mukūyeelaga mu nzīla, nūūlū mulaalile; nūūlū ng'wikanza lya kūbūūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyandīke a ha nyango na a ha mita gwako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jing'we nī shikū ja bana bing'we ī ja kwikala ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we walahīla kūbinha bakūlūgenji bing'we, jongejiwe ū ng'wikanza ī lyose aho sī ītaalī ha sīlīlī y'igūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ng'wilang'hana, ng'ūshidima chiza pyī ī shilagalo īsho nalīng'winha, ng'ūntogwa ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ng'ūshimīzīla ū mu nzīla jakwe ī jose, na kūdimana nang'hwe mu welwa ng'holò; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho lūūlū nang'hwe ū SEEBA akūgapeeja pye a mahanga genaya gang'wīngīle. Mukūbiza na būdūla wa kūgataaja ī sī a mahanga genayo nūūlū īkī a goi mataale na galī na nguzu kūmutinda a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī hene aho mukūpanda na mhambala ja magūlū ging'we, ī lipandī lyenīlo līkūbiza ling'we; kwandīja ū kwitogolo īlo lītī na banhū kūshisha Lebanoni, na kūfuma kū mongo gwa Flati kūshisha kū nyanza ya ng'weli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atīho munhū wa kūdūla kwilwisha ning'we; ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we akūtūūla lyogohya ling'we n'idetemya hose pyī ū mu sī būlī kwene ūko mulaaje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbango n'izumo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī, ī lelo nalītūūla ū kū būtongi wing'we n'izumo kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī jilī mu kūzunya kwing'we ū kūshidima ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, īsho nalīng'winha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo izumo ūlū ng'ūlema ū kūshidima ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ūlū ng'ūgalūka ng'wīleka ī nzīla īyo nalīmulanga lelo, ng'wandya kūlondeela bamulungu bangī abo mutabamanile kwīngīīla ikanza lyose lyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlū ūkūshisha ū mu sī īyo ūlīja kwīdima ībize yako, ī ūkūjitūūla kū lūgūlū lwa Gelizimu; alīyo ī lizumo ī lyene kū lūgūlū lwa Ebali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ngūlū jenījo jilī kū nkīlo gwa mongo gwa Yolodani, kūūko n'ikūūwa īlo līlī kū lwande lwa ng'weli kū būgwa līīmi; mu sī ya Bakanani abo bakikalaga bbihī na mitī mitaale ya Moole, ng'witogolo lya Alaba kūūko na Giligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ī haha yenīyī mulī hihī kūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani, muje kwīdima ī sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīng'winha ībize ying'we. Ūlū ng'wīsola na kwandya kwikala mo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilang'hanagi gete mugadime pye a malange, nī shilagīlo īsho nalīng'winha lelo yenīyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
